  "Recommendations are supported by documentation, operational observations and structured comparison — never by assumptions, marketing materials or unverified claims.": "Aanbevelingen steunen op documentatie, operationele waarnemingen en gestructureerde vergelijking — nooit op aannames, marketingmateriaal of ongeverifieerde claims.",
